<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The alcohol had long since worn off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had to do now mattered more than the succession rite.<PG>
I would put on the red robes and the Noh mask, and take up the nata and the mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was how it was supposed to go...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I had was a single nata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As soon as I got outside, I climbed the cherry tree and surveyed the whole settlement.<PG>
Yes, I had skipped out on the succession rite.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the one heading to the graveyard clearing right now was my stand-in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That person and I had gotten our stories straight beforehand and made this plan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was all at the request of that person―<STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>.<PG>
Right now, the Kogori couple from Motoki-cho would be in the storage shed near Arata Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were hiding there so they could go help right away if danger came to <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and her friends.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bugging app had been planted in the smartphones of <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and her friends.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything happened to <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and her friends, the Kogori couple would know at once.<PG>
Even so, it seemed a somewhat reckless decision.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an ordinary person, getting from Arata Station to the settlement takes at least 2 hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That means for 2 hours after something happens, they can't help.<PG>
Well, I do understand how they feel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They must be worried sick, sending their <STYLE ID="2">daughter</STYLE> and her friends to a place where incidents like this keep happening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They looked for whatever they themselves could do, and what they arrived at was hiding in the storage shed.<PG>
But I wondered why they would go this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hadn't it occurred to the Kogori couple to attend the thirteenth-year memorial service themselves? [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, under the original plan, the Kogori couple were the ones who would attend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, that had turned into their <STYLE ID="2">daughter</STYLE> and her friends going.<PG>
But I have a vague idea of the reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most likely, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> has a danger-sense ability.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She judged it dangerous for the Kogori couple to go to the Arata settlement, so she and her friends went in their place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is how I see it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> never said so outright.<PG>
Was it because the people of the settlement fear danger sense as the witch's power?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, since I am a person of Arata too, there was the worry that I might likewise see anyone with danger sense as a threat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that was why <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> didn't tell me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One could see it that way, too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The front door opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A small figure came running out of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It was <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
If <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, who had been told to go to bed, was running out alone, then...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hand tightened on the nata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> headed swiftly for the mountain path.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\hito_ge_run_kusa01.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I followed <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, doing my best not to be noticed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\林走る夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
She was fast, as I'd expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> was smaller than me, and her five senses were keen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Chasing her without losing sight of her, and without being noticed, was hard work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I focused every nerve on my eyes and chased after <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hacked away the branches in my way with the nata as I ran, and went down the mountain along the tracks <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> had left.<PG>
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
There was a reason I hadn't stopped <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the residents saw the two of us arguing, their bloodlust would flare, and there was no telling what they would do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And above all, I could not let <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> learn what I was doing.<PG>
Once we got halfway down the mountain like this, I would call out to <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> and first try to talk her around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that didn't work―
{PAUSE ""}
it would get a little rough, but I would have to swing this nata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I would not be swinging this nata to hurt <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would be to keep there from being any more victims.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "33" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly something caught my foot, and I went down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth had I tripped on?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However used to life in Tokyo I'd gotten, for me to fall in the mountains―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You let your guard down, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A small figure stood in my way.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why are you here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">? What about the succession rite?"</STYLE><PG>
Tree vines were wound tight around my leg.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a trap for catching animals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the look of it, <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> must have foreseen that I would follow her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So she had picked the route with the trap and waited for me to be pinned down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> told me. He said the real culprit of the curse-killings is in the storage shed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Kh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if you followed me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">did you maybe come to help me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! No! You mustn't hurt those people!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Why, you ask... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Those people are not the culprits!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Why would you know that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! I'll explain properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> crouched down in front of me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm listening."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! You must not do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> tells you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... You understand by now, don't you? In this incident, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Liar."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's a lie, right? What you said."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"'Cause </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was being watched the whole time a few years ago, wasn't he?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And people still died, didn't they?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So how could </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> kill anybody?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... That's...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm... I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I get it. The one who killed people while </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was being watched was you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That way, everybody would get that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't the culprit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, cold and heat pierced my left arm at the same time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> had... 
{PAUSE ""}
stabbed me...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Guh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> made sure the knife was planted in my left arm, then slowly drew out the blade.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Haha, I went and stabbed </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you, Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, giggling vacantly―
{PAUSE ""}
could this girl really be <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her actions and her manner were so unbelievable that I doubted it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... What are you doing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's punishment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm punishing the culprit behind the curse-killings."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... I am... your family, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What...?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So what about it? If you're family, you can't be the culprit?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　That's weird logic, right? Even a kid can tell it's weird."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you would... kill your family...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm, well, sure, I don't wanna kill them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But the culprit killed this many people, right? If you tell the culprit to stop now, after all that, will they listen?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I don't want to kill anyone! I don't want you to kill anyone either, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　So don't lay a hand on the people in the storage shed!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was lying, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s the culprit, isn't he? Should I kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE><PG>
And from the eyes of <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, who had been reeling off cold-blooded words―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
big drops began to fall.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Then who's supposed to be the culprit!?</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Tell me!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Who would you accept as the culprit!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>, who had suddenly started shouting, ground her teeth, her shoulders shaking.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's a lie that this incident is a curse... Somebody's killing people... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, maybe it's you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe it's somebody from another house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe it's the people in the storage shed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who would make you happy as the culprit?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I've been thinking about it this whole time. Ever since I fought with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> at New Year's, I've been thinking. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I don't wanna think Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But, like... What would you do if the culprit was family?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I... I don't want my family doing any more bad things..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Uggh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
